WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
But for me, the real prize will be the sons and daughters

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:06.440
who live to grow up with their mothers and fathers

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.880
because millions of people are no longer being killed

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.920
in endless and undelirious wars.

